From 3a6ab3b51c3ff5a5d7b34c43485ab49a130ec01d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:12:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 32/64] P5: pistol tap-fire, jump/gravity, ground inertia, land
 slow

Player-only: SP pistols use releasedFire early-clear and
cod_pistolNextShot 120; jumpVelocity 250; accel/friction 8;
STAT_COD_LAND landing slowdown. AI keeps vanilla intervals/physics.
---
 SP/code/cgame/cg_cod.c      |  7 ++++
 SP/code/cgame/cg_cod_menu.c | 18 ++++++++
 SP/code/game/bg_cod.c       | 27 ++++++++++++
 SP/code/game/bg_cod.h       | 23 +++++++++-
 SP/code/game/bg_pmove.c     | 84 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 SP/code/game/bg_public.h    |  9 ++--
 SP/code/game/g_active.c     |  2 +
 7 files changed, 160 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/SP/code/cgame/cg_cod.c b/SP/code/cgame/cg_cod.c
